## Why This Is Asked
Tests end-to-end CV design on edge hardware, combining detection, pose estimation, and tracking with limited adaptation data.

## Key Concepts
- Monocular 6‑DoF pose from a known fiducial; PnP solution with edge-friendly detector; temporal tracking via Kalman/phi filter; 5-shot on-device adaptation; synthetic+real data; latency targets.

